      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying a profound sense of loss, as if the world itself has abandoned the version of you that felt most authentic. This feeling of being erased by the erosion of social connections is incredibly painful and deeply isolating. I hear the tragedy in your words and want you to know that your pain is valid even if the people around you have faded away. You are not a ghost; you are a person navigating a landscape that feels hollow because of your own excellent capacity for empathy.",
